ser_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-18T11:46:29-07:00","id":849374,"title":"","content":"Rights? There are no such things. If a solar wants to take it upon themselves to mete out justice to the wicked, then nothing but their own power gives them the &quot;right&quot; to punish spirits or anything else. You can punish a spirit by physically assaulting it (beatings still hurt if you are materialized), attacking its property or its metaphysical domain (e.g. building a dam over a river god's run), or by killing it outright. As for Cassandra... painters gonna paint, man. If some renaissance artist decided she'd be prettier if she didn't look remotely mediterranean, what are you gonna do?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-18T11:53:32-07:00","id":849378,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>semicasual</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/849360-lord-apollo-can-suck-my-glorious-solar-dick-nsfw?p=849374#post849374\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As for Cassandra... painters gonna paint, man. If some renaissance artist decided she'd be prettier if she didn't look remotely mediterranean, what are you gonna do?</div> </div> </div> </div>Lots of mythological/religious characters are depicted as fair skinned in Western art. Jesus is the biggest example of this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-18T12:37:20-07:00","id":849395,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>semicasual</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/849360-lord-apollo-can-suck-my-glorious-solar-dick-nsfw?p=849374#post849374\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Rights? There are no such things. If a solar wants to take it upon themselves to mete out justice to the wicked, then nothing but their own power gives them the &quot;right&quot; to punish spirits or anything else.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I can punish punk ass gods with violence, but it would be nice to know whether the law allows that or not X'D<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-18T12:46:18-07:00","id":849400,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/849360-lord-apollo-can-suck-my-glorious-solar-dick-nsfw?p=849395#post849395\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, I can punish punk ass gods with violence, but it would be nice to know whether the law allows that or not X'D<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well, in setting, the Immaculate Order does do just that, so by the laws of the Realm, yeah, that's definitely a thing.<br /> <br /> Outside of the Realm, there's been a fair bit of fiction that dealt with Exalts beating the crap out of gods/spirits for stepping out of line, so while I can't say for certain if the Celestrial Bureaucracy &quot;allows&quot; it, clearly no one has the gumption to stop them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-18T12:47:44-07:00","id":849402,"title":"","content":"It's not law so much as politics. You know how the Republican Party is desperately looking for a way to force Donald Trump out of the primaries because he's toxic to the party? It's like that. In most cases, gods won't be punished for breaking the law, they'll be punished for offending someone, and the law is just a convenient way to get rid of them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-18T14:37:58-07:00","id":849458,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>semicasual</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/849360-lord-apollo-can-suck-my-glorious-solar-dick-nsfw?p=849374#post849374\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If some renaissance artist decided she'd be prettier if she didn't look remotely mediterranean, what are you gonna do?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, specifically the painting in the OP is, apparently a Roman era Pompeii, so not exactly Renaissance. <br /> <br /> There's enough variation within Greeks that some artist in ancient Rome could make Cassandra auburn haired and fair skinned. Influenced by some traditional beauty standards that aren't modern - compare how Chinese, Korean, Japanese women in medieval era paintings generally just do not really have a skin tone that is or was that common in their countries, where people are a little browner than in Greece and Italy if anything. It's not that there's some mythological standard or anything, and it doesn't matter either way. Ajax is probably the more exaggerated of the two up there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/929-ghosthead","name":"Ghosthead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-18T15:37:59-07:00","id":849484,"title":"","content":"Besides, I very vaguely recall a thing about fair women being considered more beautiful on account of they could luxuriate inside while dark men were obviously out being manly all the time in the sun. Kind of like muscular men/skinny woman today.<br /> Anyways, I believe the thing you're thinking of is called the Mandate of Heaven, where the Sun said &quot;I'm not going to throw my weight around in Creation, you guys do your thing&quot; to Merela and co., and that was later interpreted to extend to all Exalted. So, it's a thing Sol said, which is fairly lawful, and most gods loyal to him stick more or less to the spirit of it. In places like An-Teng that don't really have a strong Exalted presence (IIRC anyways), they probably step up a little like the Golden Lord and Pale Mistress.<br /> If you really want to make that law stick Creationwide, though, you need a Creationwide government, either by reforming the hell out of Heaven or conquering the world yourself. Either one probably involves judicious use of daiklave.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But sexually.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1797-ellis","name":"Ellis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1797_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","valu